    "created_at": "2026-01-06T18:41:59Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-01-06T18:41:59Z",
    "body": "After some offline discussion, I think that yes we should revert that change because the `justify-self: dialog` and `place-self: dialog` properties/values are no longer valid. The properties which were there before tab's change are the same ones that I can see in chromium.\n\nAs for the popover-alignment WPTs, they don't seem to use any of the removed `dialog` values for CSS proprties. If they pass in chromium, that means that reverting tab's change should mean that the spec matches the tests, right?",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
